Scheme name:
cm

Status:
Provisional

Applications/protocols that use this scheme name:
A cm URI is a domain-free identifier (no host, no "//") that names a stable,
local-scope referent, unique within its namespace. Its structure and
semantics are defined by the specification (in preparation). Any cm URI shown
in referenced material is a non-normative example only.

